  "sn12.44:1.1": "sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … ",
  "sn12.44:1.2": "lokassa bhikkhave samudayañca atthaṅgamañca desessāmi ",
  "sn12.44:1.3": "taṃ suṇātha … ",
  "sn12.44:1.4": "",
  "sn12.44:1.5": "",
  "sn12.44:2.1": "katamo ca bhikkhave lokassa samudayo. ",
  "sn12.44:2.2": "cakkhuñca paṭicca rūpe ca uppajjati cakkhuviññāṇaṃ tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso ",
  "sn12.44:2.3": "phassapaccayā vedanā ",
  "sn12.44:2.4": "vedanāpaccayā taṇhā ",
  "sn12.44:2.5": "taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṃ ",
  "sn12.44:2.6": "upādānapaccayā bhavo ",
  "sn12.44:2.7": "bhavapaccayā jāti ",
  "sn12.44:2.8": "jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṃ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti ",
  "sn12.44:2.9": "ayaṃ kho bhikkhave lokassa samudayo. ",
  "sn12.44:3.1": "sotañca paṭicca sadde ca … ",
