  "sn12.44:3.3": "jivhañca paṭicca rase ca … ",
  "sn12.44:3.4": "kāyañca paṭicca phoṭṭhabbe ca … ",
  "sn12.44:3.5": "manañca paṭicca dhamme ca uppajjati manoviññāṇaṃ tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso ",
  "sn12.44:3.6": "phassapaccayā vedanā …pe… ",
  "sn12.44:3.7": "jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṃ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti ",
  "sn12.44:3.8": "ayaṃ kho bhikkhave lokassa samudayo. ",
  "sn12.44:4.1": "katamo ca bhikkhave lokassa atthaṅgamo. ",
  "sn12.44:4.2": "cakkhuñca paṭicca rūpe ca uppajjati cakkhuviññāṇaṃ tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso ",
  "sn12.44:4.3": "phassapaccayā vedanā ",
